{"ref":"BDB, תְּנוּךְ","hw":"תְּנוּךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>tip</strong>, i.e. <strong>lobe</strong> of ear <strong>(</strong>𝔊 λοβὸς τοῦ ὠτός, 𝔙 <em>extremum auriculae</em>, and so most ancient authorities, cf. Thes<sup>1511</sup><strong>)</strong>;—cstr. in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ אֹזֶן פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:20\" href=\"/Exodus.29.20\">Ex 29:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.23\">Lv 8:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.14\">14:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.28\">28</a> (all P).","next":"BDB, תְּנוּמָה²","prev":"BDB, תנך"}